            "expect": "fs1:b836d55de9738e7e",
            "note": "Swivel fold tool. Hold Option (Alt on Windows and Linux) and click inside the paper halfway between the centre and the bottom edge: where the creases meet. Then click three landmarks the creases run to: the right edge’s midpoint, the left edge’s midpoint, the bottom edge’s midpoint. Click the upper left of the paper (it stays put). Fourth crease 1 of 3, straight up the middle, is the first that fits: the paper folds in half while its bottom swivels. Press Enter."
          },
